# doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"   # fill after the first Zenodo release (a GitHub Release mints it)
# omnibias ships two licence tiers: the 28 permissive packages (the derivative
# tower and its consumers) are Apache-2.0, and the 14 certified-decision
# packages are AGPL-3.0-or-later or commercial. CFF takes a single value, so
# this records the tier that covers `omnibias-core`. See LICENSING.md.
license: "Apache-2.0"
